\code{\link[=triSubTab]{triSubTab()}}, \code{\link[=triSubSidebarTab]{triSubSidebarTab()}} and \code{\link[=subTwoColPage]{subTwoColPage()}} go inside them.
\item \strong{Inputs:} \code{\link[=navButton]{navButton()}}, \code{\link[=navSelect]{navSelect()}}, \code{\link[=navUpload]{navUpload()}}, \code{\link[=navDownload]{navDownload()}},
